OL,3,GNEWSAChild safety charity seeks
OL,4,Avolunteers for schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which works to keep children
OL,7,Fsafe from abuse is seeking volunteers
OL,8,Ffor its school service.
OL,10,FNSPCC in Jersey said it needed people
OL,11,Fto go into primary schools help them
OL,12,Funderstand different forms of abuse and
OL,13,Fwhat to do if they had any concerns.
OL,15,FThe Speak Out, Stay Safe programme
OL,16,Fincludes a pre-prepared and
OL,17,Fage-appropriate assembly presentation
OL,18,Ffollowed by workshops which delivered
OL,19,Fby volunteers, the charity explained.
